# Project Zero — Git ignore rules

# EXP002 raw master data (spot XAU/USD tick export) is preserved locally as the
# immutable master but is NOT committed: full 2003–2026 tick data exceeds
# practical Git limits. See
# experiments/EXP002-gold-trend-following/evidence/raw/README.md (Option 1).
# Only the non-data record files in that raw area are tracked.
experiments/EXP002-gold-trend-following/evidence/raw/*
!experiments/EXP002-gold-trend-following/evidence/raw/README.md
!experiments/EXP002-gold-trend-following/evidence/raw/provenance.md